ity.", "KROMHOUT D:Kromhout D is a researcher known for his significant contributions to the field of nutrition and cardiovascular health. He is involved in the Seven Countries Study, which investigates the impact of dietary fats on heart disease mortality. Additionally, Kromhout D has conducted research examining the relationship between n-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular events specifically in post-myocardial infarction patients who have diabetes. His work highlights the importance of dietary components in managing heart health and preventing cardiovascular diseases.", "BOSCH J:Bosch J is a researcher involved in the Origin Trial, which examined n-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular outcomes in patients with dysglycemia.", "KRIS-ETHERTON PM:Kris-Etherton PM is a prominent researcher and author known for his extensive studies on the impact of fish consumption and omega-3 fatty acids on cardiovascular disease. His research also delves into the effects of individual fatty acids on plasma lipids and lipoproteins, contributing valuable insights to the understanding of dietary influences on heart health.", "DELHANTY LM:Delahanty LM is a researcher who contributed to the Diabetes Control and Complications Trial, focusing on diet and glycated hemoglobin in type 1 diabetes.", "BRAND-MILLER J:Brand-Miller J is a researcher who conducted a meta-analysis on low-glycemic index diets in diabetes management.", "OPPERMAN AM:Opperman AM is a researcher who analyzed the health effects of using the glycemic index in meal planning for diabetes.", "WORAICH ML:Woraich ML is a researcher who studied the effects of high sucrose or aspartame diets on children's behavior and cognitive performance.", "SERRA-MAJEM L:Serra-Majem L is a researcher who contributed to the Chinchón Declaration on low- and no-calorie sweeteners.", "HOWARD AA:Howard AA is a researcher who conducted a systematic review on the effects of alcohol consumption on diabetes mellitus.", "GARG A:", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO SEVERO OCHOA:Hospital Universitario Severo Ochoa is a medical institution located in Leganés, Madrid, specializing in endocrinology and nutrition.", "DOLRES DEL OLMO:Dolores del Olmo is an author contributing to the chapter on the importance of diet in diabetes mellitus management."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}